  "steps": [
    "Rinse the lentils, cover with water, and simmer 15-20 minutes until just tender.",
    "Slice the onions thinly and fry in olive oil until deeply caramelized and crisp — set most aside for topping, keep some in the pot.",
    "Add the rice to the lentil pot, cook together until the rice is tender and most of the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Season with salt and pepper.",
    "Toss the salad veggies with olive oil, lemon juice, and crushed garlic.",
    "Serve the mjadara topped with the crispy onions, alongside the salad and pita bread."
